{
  "$comment": "The fields of sheet 'POC Data' (rows 5-40) of the workbook, one entry per prop, in workbook order. This file is the single list that the database columns, the API, the data contract and the Vue client are checked against. prop/displayName/step/type/control/required are the workbook columns A-F. column is the PostgreSQL column of gea.\"Project\" or gea.\"Run\" (a date range is two columns, Start and End; the list of date ranges is the table gea.\"RunStudyPeriodExclusion\"). options are the example values of sheet 'Draft - Modelling team'; they seed gea.\"ParameterOption\" and are not enforced.",
  "source": "PLRe_GEA_UX_UI_Functional_Specification_v5.xlsx#POC Data",
  "specVersion": "1.0",
  "steps": [
    {"key": "main", "title": "Main"},
    {"key": "dataAndSetUp", "title": "Data and set up"},
    {"key": "segmentation", "title": "Segmentation"},
    {"key": "actuals", "title": "Actuals"},
    {"key": "ibnr", "title": "IBNR"},
    {"key": "assigningExpected", "title": "Assigning expected"},
    {"key": "ultimateCalculation", "title": "Ultimate calculation"},
    {"key": "actualExpected", "title": "Actual / Expected"}
  ],
  "createProject": [
